WEBVTT

00:06:27.413 --> 00:06:30.371
a multidrug resistant strand
of tuberculosis.

00:06:30.913 --> 00:06:34.663
Simple designs for infection control
had not been thought about,

00:06:34.663 --> 00:06:39.746
and people had died because of it.
Where are the architects?

00:06:39.996 --> 00:06:43.121
Paul said if hospitals are
making people sicker,

00:06:43.329 --> 00:06:46.913
where are the architects and
designers to help us build

00:06:46.913 --> 00:06:49.663
and design hospitals that
allow us to heal?

00:06:52.121 --> 00:06:57.704
And there in that moment, I think
the link emerged that we in

00:06:57.704 --> 00:07:00.663
the architectural and design professionals
are providing and working